    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
      <uighur>čiγulγan</uighur>
      <cyrillic>цулган - цуглаан</cyrillic>
      <transcript>CIΓULΓAN</transcript>
      <definition>n. Gathering, throng, society; assembly meeting; league, confederacy (Ch. meng ), the largest military-administrative units consisting of a number of xosiγun , q. v. ; they were formed during the Manchu dynasty and survived until the advent of Communism, when they were replaced by aimaγ, q.v.), cf. cuγlaγ-a(n),</definition>
      <page>178</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠢ ᠲᠠᠷᠬᠠᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- I tarxaγaxu</transcript>
          <definition>To dismiss a meeting.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠤᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- u daruγ-a</transcript>
          <definition>Chief of aleague.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠭᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- u ger</transcript>
          <definition>Meeting house or hall.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠤᠲᠤᠭ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>nutuγ un</transcript>
          <definition>Regional assembly</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
      <transcript>CIΓULΓAN</transcript>
      <definition>T. tshogs cing; S. parivira. The assembly or "conclave" of deities or retainers of the Bu. as appearing in legend, iconography, and cult. See nøkyr</definition>
      <page>1166</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠤᠶᠠᠨ ᠺᠢᠭᠡᠳ ᠪᠡᠯᠭᠡ ᠪᠢᠯᠢᠭ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>+++ bujan kiged belge bilig --</transcript>
          <definition>'; T. bsod nams dangye çes kyi tshogs; S. punya-jnana-sambhara . Equipment of merit and knowledge (required for the path to Buddhahood ).ED 580 a.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠡᠵᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>+++ -- u ezen ;</transcript>
          <definition>T. tshogs kyi bdag po, tshogs bdag; S. Gagapati, Ganepa, Ganesha, the famous Indian elephant-headed god of wisdom, also known as leader of demigods in shivaism</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Kowalewski</dico>
      <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠣᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
      <definition>1 foule, troupe, multitude, société, tas, bande, troupeau, cohue; &#13;
2 assemblée, réunion, diète; &#13;
3 une division, un corps d'armée; &#13;
4 masse, amas , somme, un tout: objet, chose, corps, chair, et tout ce qui est composé, complexe, matériel</definition>
      <page>2146</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠷᠠᠳ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤᠯᠠᠨ ᠬᠤᠷᠠᠪᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>une foule de peuple s'assembla</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠮᠦᠭ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>armée, les troupes, l'armement</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠣᠤᠷᠯᠠᠬᠤ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠢ ᠵᠡᠭᠡᠳᠭᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>aggrandir la masse du mal</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠤᠷᠪᠠᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠺᠦᠷᠦᠭ</unicode>
          <definition>image qui se forme de trois objets</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠤᠶᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>la somme, un amas de vertus</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠡᠴᠡᠭ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>une quantité de fleurs, bouquet</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠩᠷᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>assemblée des tégris</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠯᠣᠤᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>réunion ou rendez-vous de serpents</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠡᠰᠡᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>une quantité de glaives</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠡᠵᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>chef, chef d'une foule: Khormousda (Ganeça)</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠦᠭᠡ</unicode>
          <definition>discours prononcé devant une assemblée</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠨᠣᠶᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>le président de l'assemblée, de la diète</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠠᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>l'assemblée se disperse</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠢ ᠬᠤᠷᠢᠶᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>convoquer l'assemblée</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠤᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <definition>le chef d'un corps de l'armée</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠬᠠᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>congédier l'assemblée</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠡᠭᠡᠳᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>président de l'assemblée ou de la diète</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠮᠥᠷᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>le fleuve de l'assemblée, fleuve dans l'Inde</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠴᠠᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>convoquer l'assemblée ou la diète</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠭᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <definition>maison de l'assemblée</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠢᠯᠢᠨᠴᠡᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠴᠢᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠨ ᠪᠠᠭᠤᠷᠠᠪᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>le nombre de péchés diminua</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
